'''Corrupted Moneko''' (狂乱のスターもねこ ''Kyōran no Sutā Moneko'', '''Crazed Star Moneko''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[in THE MOON]] and [[Heavenly Tower]] [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 47|Floor 47]]. She was added in [[Version 6.10 Update|Version 6.10]].

